<title>UK: John Lewis UK dept stores sales up 8.0% latest wk.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK dept stores sales up 8.0% latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said its UK department store sales rose 8.0 percent in the week to March 8 over the same week a year ago.</p>
<p>There was a rise of 9.0 percent in the six weeks to March 8.</p>
<p>Total sales, including those from the Waitrose supermarket chain, rose 7.4 percent in the week to March 8 compared with the year earlier week. There was a rise of 6.9 percent for the six-week trading period.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
